          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To multiply fractions, we multiply the numerators, multiply the denominators, and simplify (if necessary).</p>",
            "readable_text": "To multiply fractions, we multiply the numerators, multiply the denominators, and simplify (if necessary).",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, to multiply <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 1 {2} \\times \\dfrac 1 {3},]</span> we multiply the numerators and we multiply the denominators:</p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, to multiply [MATH: \\dfrac 1 {2} \\times \\dfrac 1 {3},] we multiply the numerators and we multiply the denominators:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{\\color{blue}1}{\\color{red}2} \\times \\dfrac{\\color{blue}1}{\\color{red}3} =  \\dfrac {{\\color{blue}1}\\times {\\color{blue}1}} {{\\color{red}2}\\times {\\color{red}3}} = \\dfrac{1}{6}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: \\dfrac{\\color{blue}1}{\\color{red}2} \\times \\dfrac{\\color{blue}1}{\\color{red}3} = \\dfrac {{\\color{blue}1}\\times {\\color{blue}1}} {{\\color{red}2}\\times {\\color{red}3}} = \\dfrac{1}{6}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Notice that we get the same answer when we use a fraction model.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Notice that we get the same answer when we use a fraction model.",
            "images": [],
