            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To multiply two fractions, we multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac 3 {7} \\times \\dfrac 1 {4} =  \\dfrac {3\\times 1} {7\\times 4} = \\dfrac{3}{28}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To multiply two fractions, we multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n\n[MATH: \\dfrac 3 {7} \\times \\dfrac 1 {4} = \\dfrac {3\\times 1} {7\\times 4} = \\dfrac{3}{28}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
